      "content": "thanks for that. i'm a bit confused though, you said the interval was -0.55 to 0.55, but the numbers i gave you were [0.02, 0.85]. wasn't that interval entirely positive?\n\nalso, when you say the significance is \"ambiguous,\" are you saying the \"noise\" or random error in my data might be masking the real trend? how do i actually write about that uncertainty in my discussion section without sounding like my results are totally unreliable?",
